Hanumān enters night Laṅkā from Lamba peak --- Hanumān marvels at golden gates and jewelled mansions --- Hanumān judges city impregnable save few monkeys --- Hanumān takes heart from Rāma Lakṣmaṇa prowess --- Hanumān sees lamp-lit city like adorned woman --- Hanumān hears songs anklets and Vēda praise of Rāvaṇa --- Hanumān faces hundred-thousand-strong middle guard of rākṣasas --- Hanumān enters guarded Rāvaṇa palace with elephants and chariots
